{"leccion":{"n":265,"clase":65,"bloque":9,"slug":"leccion-265","titulo":"Los peones centrales móviles","fecha":"7/12/2001","resumen":"La movilidad de los peones centrales es uno de los objetivos que, ya desde la apertura, ambos bandos intentan conseguir.","que_veras":[],"conclusiones":[],"items":[{"tipo":"texto","texto":"La movilidad de los peones centrales es uno de los objetivos que, ya desde la apertura, ambos bandos intentan conseguir."},{"tipo":"texto","texto":"En algunas posiciones uno de los bandos consigue una mayoría de peones central, pero de ordinario su adversario trata de controlar las casillas centrales de modo que el avance de los peones se vea obstaculizado. En estos casos se suele entablar una batalla por esas casillas, que puede llegar a decidir todo el curso de la partida. En los ejemplos que veremos en la clase de hoy, se ilustran alguno de los métodos empleador para poner en marcha el centro de peones y los problemas que dicho centro puede causar al adversario si no consigue detenerlos."},{"tipo":"texto","texto":"El primer ejemplo muestra una posición que nos puede resultar algo familiar:"},{"tipo":"partida","id":"ml065-1"},{"tipo":"texto","texto":"El control de la casilla \"e4\" es fundamental es esquemas como el que acabamos de ver. La sobredefensa de ese punto es algo que las negras no deben perder de vista, como veremos en las siguiente partida."},{"tipo":"partida","id":"ml065-2"},{"tipo":"texto","texto":"Movilizar nuestro centro de peones requiere eliminar los obstáculos que se oponen a su avance, de ordinario los peones adversarios, mediante el cambio."},{"tipo":"texto","texto":"La siguiente partida es muy instructiva en este sentido:"},{"tipo":"partida","id":"ml065-3"}]},"partidas":{"ml065-1":{"id":"ml065-1","blancas":"M. Taimanov","negras":"M. Botvinnik","evento":"URSS-ch Moscú, 1952","apertura":"","eco":"","resultado":"1-0","start_fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/8/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 1","orientacion":"w","moves":[{"n":1,"color":"w","san":"d4","uci":"d2d4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/8/3P4/8/PPP1PPPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 1","gap":false},{"n":1,"color":"b","san":"Nf6","uci":"g8f6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppppppp/5n2/8/3P4/8/PPP1PPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 1 2","gap":false},{"n":2,"color":"w","san":"c4","uci":"c2c4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppppppp/5n2/8/2PP4/8/PP2PPPP/RNBQKBNR b KQkq - 0 2","gap":false},{"n":2,"color":"b","san":"e6","uci":"e7e6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/2PP4/8/PP2PPPP/RNBQKBNR w KQkq - 0 3","gap":false},{"n":3,"color":"w","san":"Nc3","uci":"b1c3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqkb1r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/2PP4/2N5/PP2PPPP/R1BQKBNR b KQkq - 1 3","gap":false},{"n":3,"color":"b","san":"Bb4","uci":"f8b4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/1bPP4/2N5/PP2PPPP/R1BQKBNR w KQkq - 2 4","gap":false},{"n":4,"color":"w","san":"Nf3","uci":"g1f3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqk2r/pppp1ppp/4pn2/8/1bPP4/2N2N2/PP2PPPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 3 4","gap":false},{"n":4,"color":"b","san":"c5","uci":"c7c5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqk2r/pp1p1ppp/4pn2/2p5/1bPP4/2N2N2/PP2PPPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 5","gap":false},{"n":5,"color":"w","san":"e3","uci":"e2e3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbqk2r/pp1p1ppp/4pn2/2p5/1bPP4/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 5","gap":false},{"n":5,"color":"b","san":"O-O","uci":"e8g8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/pp1p1ppp/4pn2/2p5/1bPP4/2N1PN2/PP3PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQ - 1 6","gap":false},{"n":6,"color":"w","san":"Bd3","uci":"f1d3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/pp1p1ppp/4pn2/2p5/1bPP4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R1BQK2R b KQ - 2 6","gap":false},{"n":6,"color":"b","san":"d5","uci":"d7d5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/pp3ppp/4pn2/2pp4/1bPP4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R1BQK2R w KQ - 0 7","gap":false},{"n":7,"color":"w","san":"O-O","uci":"e1g1","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"rnbq1rk1/pp3ppp/4pn2/2pp4/1bPP4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 1 7","gap":false},{"n":7,"color":"b","san":"Nc6","uci":"b8c6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp3ppp/2n1pn2/2pp4/1bPP4/2NBPN2/PP3PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 2 8","gap":false},{"n":8,"color":"w","san":"a3","uci":"a2a3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp3ppp/2n1pn2/2pp4/1bPP4/P1NBPN2/1P3PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 0 8","gap":false},{"n":8,"color":"b","san":"Bxc3","uci":"b4c3","nag":"","comentario":"(La lucha contra los peones doblados es uno de los temas estratégicos más importantes en esta variante de la Defensa Nimzoindia, y las negras realizan este cambio gustosas, a pesar de renunciar a la pareja de alfiles. La alternativa es (8...cxd4 9.exd4 dxc4 10.Axc4 Ae7)","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp3ppp/2n1pn2/2pp4/2PP4/P1bBPN2/1P3PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 0 9","gap":false},{"n":9,"color":"w","san":"bxc3","uci":"b2c3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/pp3ppp/2n1pn2/2pp4/2PP4/P1PBPN2/5PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 0 9","gap":false},{"n":9,"color":"b","san":"b6","uci":"b7b6","nag":"","comentario":"(Un plan más habitual es 9...Dc7 directamente o previo cambio en c4, para luego seguir con...e6-e5.)","fen":"r1bq1rk1/p4ppp/1pn1pn2/2pp4/2PP4/P1PBPN2/5PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 0 10","gap":false},{"n":10,"color":"w","san":"cxd5","uci":"c4d5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/p4ppp/1pn1pn2/2pP4/3P4/P1PBPN2/5PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 0 10","gap":false},{"n":10,"color":"b","san":"exd5","uci":"e6d5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/2pp4/3P4/P1PBPN2/5PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 0 11","gap":false},{"n":11,"color":"w","san":"a4","uci":"a3a4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/2pp4/P2P4/2PBPN2/5PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 0 11","gap":false},{"n":11,"color":"b","san":"c4","uci":"c5c4","nag":"","comentario":"Esta jugada siempre lleva cierto riesgo. Ciertamente tiene lógica, ahora que las blancas debilitaron su casilla b3 con su última jugada, y además establece una mayoría de peones en el flanco de dama. Sin embargo, afloja la presión sobre el centro blanco y da facilidades para que las blancas puedan realizar el plan f3-e4. El propio Botvinnik había ganado con blancas, una brillante partida a Capablanca, en 1936, partida que ha salido publicada en casi todos los libros.","fen":"r1bq1rk1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p4/P1pP4/2PBPN2/5PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 0 12","gap":false},{"n":12,"color":"w","san":"Bc2","uci":"d3c2","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r1bq1rk1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p4/P1pP4/2P1PN2/2B2PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 1 12","gap":false},{"n":12,"color":"b","san":"Bg4","uci":"c8g4","nag":"?!","comentario":"(Una jugada muy natural, pero posiblemente inadecuada. Lo que requiere la posición es comenzar la lucha por las casillas centrales, y para ello parece mejor 12...Ce4 13.De1 (13.Axe4 dxe4 14.Cd2 f5 15.Cxc4? Aa6) 13...Te8 Una partida Szabo-Najdorf. Zurich 1953 siguió 14.Ab2 Af5 15.Cd2 Dg5 16.Cxe4 Axe4 17.Axe4 Txe4 y las negras lograron un juego muy satisfactorio.)","fen":"r2q1rk1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p4/P1pP2b1/2P1PN2/2B2PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 2 13","gap":false},{"n":13,"color":"w","san":"Qe1","uci":"d1e1","nag":"!","comentario":"(No hay que temer el cambio en f3 que dejaría a las blancas una fuerte masa de peones en el centro y una columna abierta sobre el enroque, que se podría aprovechar en seguida con Rh1 y Tg1. Ahora la utilidad de 12...Ag4 queda en entredicho, pues tras retirar el caballo, las blancas ganan un tiempo con f3 para avanzar sus peones centrales.","fen":"r2q1rk1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p4/P1pP2b1/2P1PN2/2B2PPP/R1B1QRK1 b - - 3 13","gap":false},{"n":13,"color":"b","san":"Re8","uci":"f8e8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p4/P1pP2b1/2P1PN2/2B2PPP/R1B1QRK1 w - - 4 14","gap":false},{"n":14,"color":"w","san":"Nh4","uci":"f3h4","nag":"!","comentario":"(Manteniendo la casilla f5 bajo control. Anteriormente se había jugado 14.Cd2 y tras 14...Ce7 15.f3 Af5 16.e4 Ag6 las negras quedaron bien. Tolush-Keres. Tallin 1945.)","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p4/P1pP2bN/2P1P3/2B2PPP/R1B1QRK1 b - - 5 14","gap":false},{"n":14,"color":"b","san":"Bh5","uci":"g4h5","nag":"","comentario":"(Este desarrollo de alfil traerá problemas a las negras. Es interesante 14...Ca5 15.f3 Ac8 como se jugó en una partida Taimanov- Bondarevsky. Leningrado 1952 que siguió 16.Aa3 Cb3 17.Ta2 Ad7 18.e4 dxe4 19.fxe4 Ac6 20.e5 Cxd4 21.cxd4 Dxd4+ con posibilidades equilibradas.)","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p3b/P1pP3N/2P1P3/2B2PPP/R1B1QRK1 w - - 6 15","gap":false},{"n":15,"color":"w","san":"f3","uci":"f2f3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4ppp/1pn2n2/3p3b/P1pP3N/2P1PP2/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 b - - 0 15","gap":false},{"n":15,"color":"b","san":"Bg6","uci":"h5g6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4ppp/1pn2nb1/3p4/P1pP3N/2P1PP2/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 w - - 1 16","gap":false},{"n":16,"color":"w","san":"Nxg6","uci":"h4g6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4ppp/1pn2nN1/3p4/P1pP4/2P1PP2/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 b - - 0 16","gap":false},{"n":16,"color":"b","san":"hxg6","uci":"h7g6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4pp1/1pn2np1/3p4/P1pP4/2P1PP2/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 w - - 0 17","gap":false},{"n":17,"color":"w","san":"e4","uci":"e3e4","nag":"","comentario":"(Con esto se ha completado el plan blanco. Ahora las negras cambian en e4, porque de otro modo seguiría e5 y luego la ruptura f4 y f5 sería dificil de evitar)","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4pp1/1pn2np1/3p4/P1pPP3/2P2P2/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 b - - 0 17","gap":false},{"n":17,"color":"b","san":"dxe4","uci":"d5e4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4pp1/1pn2np1/8/P1pPp3/2P2P2/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 w - - 0 18","gap":false},{"n":18,"color":"w","san":"fxe4","uci":"f3e4","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r2qr1k1/p4pp1/1pn2np1/8/P1pPP3/2P5/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 b - - 0 18","gap":false},{"n":18,"color":"b","san":"Qd7","uci":"d8d7","nag":"","comentario":"(No es posible 18...Cxe4 19.Axe4 f5 20.Axc6 ganando mucho material por la dama.)","fen":"r3r1k1/p2q1pp1/1pn2np1/8/P1pPP3/2P5/2B3PP/R1B1QRK1 w - - 1 19","gap":false},{"n":19,"color":"w","san":"Bg5","uci":"c1g5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2q1pp1/1pn2np1/6B1/P1pPP3/2P5/2B3PP/R3QRK1 b - - 2 19","gap":false},{"n":19,"color":"b","san":"Nh7","uci":"f6h7","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2q1ppn/1pn3p1/6B1/P1pPP3/2P5/2B3PP/R3QRK1 w - - 3 20","gap":false},{"n":20,"color":"w","san":"Be3","uci":"g5e3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2q1ppn/1pn3p1/8/P1pPP3/2P1B3/2B3PP/R3QRK1 b - - 4 20","gap":false},{"n":20,"color":"b","san":"Ne7","uci":"c6e7","nag":"","comentario":"(Tampoco era satisfactorio buscar el cambio de damas con 20...Cf6 21.Dh4 Dg4 pues la simple 22.Dxg4 (22.Df2 también es fuerte) 22...Cxg4 23.Af4 deja a las blancas con una clara ventaja.)","fen":"r3r1k1/p2qnppn/1p4p1/8/P1pPP3/2P1B3/2B3PP/R3QRK1 w - - 5 21","gap":false},{"n":21,"color":"w","san":"Rf3","uci":"f1f3","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2qnppn/1p4p1/8/P1pPP3/2P1BR2/2B3PP/R3Q1K1 b - - 6 21","gap":false},{"n":21,"color":"b","san":"f5","uci":"f7f5","nag":"","comentario":"Estratégicamente es correcta esta jugada, para bloquear los peones centrales y oponerse a la amenaza Th3 y Dh4. Pero el punto negativo es que debilita el peón g6 y ello tendrá influencia decisiva en el desarrollo de la partida.","fen":"r3r1k1/p2qn1pn/1p4p1/5p2/P1pPP3/2P1BR2/2B3PP/R3Q1K1 w - - 0 22","gap":false},{"n":22,"color":"w","san":"e5","uci":"e4e5","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2qn1pn/1p4p1/4Pp2/P1pP4/2P1BR2/2B3PP/R3Q1K1 b - - 0 22","gap":false},{"n":22,"color":"b","san":"Nf8","uci":"h7f8","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3rnk1/p2qn1p1/1p4p1/4Pp2/P1pP4/2P1BR2/2B3PP/R3Q1K1 w - - 1 23","gap":false},{"n":23,"color":"w","san":"h4","uci":"h2h4","nag":"","comentario":"(Para seguir eventualmente con h5 y socavar la defensa de f5)","fen":"r3rnk1/p2qn1p1/1p4p1/4Pp2/P1pP3P/2P1BR2/2B3P1/R3Q1K1 b - - 0 23","gap":false},{"n":23,"color":"b","san":"Ne6","uci":"f8e6","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2qn1p1/1p2n1p1/4Pp2/P1pP3P/2P1BR2/2B3P1/R3Q1K1 w - - 1 24","gap":false},{"n":24,"color":"w","san":"Rd1","uci":"a1d1","nag":"","comentario":"","fen":"r3r1k1/p2qn1p1/1p2n1p1/4Pp2/P1pP3P/2P1BR2/2B3P1/3RQ1K1 b - - 2 24","gap":false},{"n":24,"color":"b","san":"Qd5","uci"